{"id": "NOANS-003", "question": "Cách nấu phở bò chuẩn vị Hà Nội?", "tenant": "default", "expect_refusal": true, "reason": "OUT_OF_SCOPE", "expected_sources": [], "forbidden_source_ids": [], "probe_terms": ["nau an", "mon an", "cong thuc nau", "ngoi", "ha noi", "pho bo"], "notes": "Entirely outside the enterprise knowledge domain. The retriever should retrieve nothing semantically related. NOTE: the bare term \"phở\" cannot be used as a probe because norm_tokens() strips diacritics, so \"phở\" (noodle soup) collides with \"thành phố\" (city) which occurs in the taxi/Grab reimbursement clause. Probing the full compound avoids the collision instead of hiding it."}
